Template: quicksand-agent/key
Type: string
Default:
Description: Quicksand server's public key:
 The agent only accepts connections from the Quicksand server with this key
 ("ed25519:..."). It is on Quicksand's Admin page, or run
 "quicksand agent pubkey" on the server.
 .
 Leave it empty to configure the agent later with
 "quicksand-agent install -key ...".

Template: quicksand-agent/subnet
Type: string
Default: 10.99.0.0/24
Description: Agent network:
 The agent network's subnet, as in Quicksand's configuration.
